# Loaded automatically by `npm run build` and `npm run preview` (Vite's
# production mode). Safe to commit: this is a public URL, not a secret.
#
# A built bundle has no Vite dev proxy, so the browser talks to Railway
# directly. The deployed frontend's own origin must therefore be listed in the
# backend's CORS_ALLOWED_ORIGINS.
#
# Must be the *public* domain. `backend.railway.internal` resolves only inside
# Railway's private network and is unreachable from a browser.
VITE_API_BASE_URL=https://backend-production-9f759.up.railway.app/api
